  "title": "Qt: Parent the ProfileSwitcher and the PacketDiagram QGraphicsScene",
  "description": "Parent the ProfileSwitcher and the PacketDiagram's QGraphicsScene\nappropriately when creating them to prevent leaks. (This doesn't\nexactly leak currently according to some leak analyzers, because\nwe never exit by returning from main but instead call exit via\nexit_application, which ends up never running the main application\ndestructor so it doesn't get reported as a leak because the memory\nis still in use. See #20370 and #14395.)",
